---
layout: base.njk
title: 文章
permalink: /articles/
---
{% import "cards.njk" as c %}
<section class="page-head">
  <h1>文章</h1>
  <p class="lead">自己寫的，和讀到值得分享的好文章。不分主題，照時間排。</p>
  {{ c.filters("articleList", collections.articles | uniq("kind")) }}
</section>
<ol class="entries list-page" id="articleList">
  {% for a in collections.articles %}{{ c.articleRow(a) }}{% endfor %}
</ol>
{% if not collections.articles.length %}<p class="empty list-page">第一篇文章正在寫，敬請期待。</p>{% endif %}
